OL,3,AGirl, 17, killed in Swedish sword
OL,4,Aattack, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old girl was killed in the
OL,7,Fdeadly sword attack at a high school in
OL,8,Fcentral Sweden on Friday, police have
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FTwo boys aged 12 and 17 were also
OL,12,Fseriously injured in the attack at
OL,13,FBrinell School in Fagersta, according
OL,14,Fto local authorities, while another
OL,15,Fperson sustained minor injuries.
OL,17,FAn 18-year-old man was arrested but has
OL,18,Fnot been identified. Police said they
OL,19,Fwere treating the case as murder and
OL,20,Fattempted murder.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
